    58	        PathTraversalError: If an AgentTool config_path escapes the submission root directory.
    59	        SubmissionValidationError: If an AgentTool configuration file is not found.
    60	        LimitExceededError: If sub-agent nesting depth via AgentTool exceeds ``ctx.limits.max_sub_agent_depth``.
    61	        SubmissionSchemaError: If an AgentTool configuration fails schema validation.
    62	        yaml.YAMLError: If an AgentTool YAML configuration file is malformed.
